{"ref":"BDB, תָּם","hw":"תָּם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תָּם</span></big>  <strong>adj. complete</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:27\" href=\"/Genesis.25.27\">Gn 25:27</a> + 10 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּמָּתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:2\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.2\">Ct 5:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:9\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.9\">6:9</a> (late, except <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:27\" href=\"/Genesis.25.27\">Gn 25:27</a>);—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>complete, perfect:</em> in beauty <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:2\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.2\">Ct 5:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:9\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.9\">6:9</a>; of physical strength <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:4\" href=\"/Psalms.73.4\">ψ 73:4</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">לָ֑מוֹ תָּם</span> Ew De Dr<sup>Sam xxxi</sup> Che Bae al.).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>sound, wholesome:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ תָּם</span>, of Jacob as tent-dweller, opp. Esau, hunter, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:27\" href=\"/Genesis.25.27\">Gn 25:27</a> (J; De <em>leutseliger Mann</em>, Di <em>ruhig</em>, <em>still</em>, AV RV <em>plain man;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> here poss. redactional, = <strong>3</strong>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>complete, morally innocent, having integrity:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ תָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 1:8\" href=\"/Job.1.8\">Jb 1:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 2:3\" href=\"/Job.2.3\">2:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> alone <a data-ref=\"Job 1:1\" href=\"/Job.1.1\">1:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 8:20\" href=\"/Job.8.20\">8:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 9:20\" href=\"/Job.9.20\">9:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 9:21\" href=\"/Job.9.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 9:22\" href=\"/Job.9.22\">22</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.10\">Pr 29:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:37\" href=\"/Psalms.37.37\">ψ 37:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 64:5\" href=\"/Psalms.64.5\">64:5</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">תַּמִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:24\" href=\"/Exodus.26.24\">Ex 26:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:29\" href=\"/Exodus.36.29\">36:29</a> v. [<a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, תאם\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_תאם\">תָּאם</a>].","next":"BDB, תָּמִים","prev":"BDB, תֻּמָּה"}